WEBVTT

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:00.546
"Oh, there's a new restaurant nearby,
you want to come check it out?"

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:03.476
And every, every other week I would say,

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:06.982
"I'm going to salsa dancing.
Who's coming with me?"

00:16:07.006 --> 00:16:08.918
And still nobody did.

00:16:08.942 --> 00:16:10.613
AG: Luz was starved for belonging,

00:16:10.637 --> 00:16:13.827
for a sense of connection
with people she identified with.

00:16:13.851 --> 00:16:15.842
She realized that her New York colleagues

00:16:15.866 --> 00:16:17.975
weren't going to get as social
as she wanted.

00:16:17.999 --> 00:16:20.546
She needed to do something
to combat her loneliness.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:23.776
So she decided to build
a workplace community from scratch.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.896
She started with interns.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:29.526
LC: Yes, I was able to secure funding

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:34.651
to bring in underrepresented
minorities in science